  "notes": "Needs MIDI FLT > CTRL CHG = ENABLE. CC numbers are the factory CC MAP (GLOBAL > CC MAP can change them). CCs act on the timbre of their channel: timbre 1 on the global channel, timbre 2 on T2MIDI.CH in MULTI mode. NRPNs (arp, voice mode, vocoder, virtual patch) go to the global channel and use only the Data Entry MSB. Values from the German manual's MIDI chapter, untested. FX CTRL-1/2 control the parameters assigned on the MST FX pages. EQ gain is centred (±15 dB). The arp gate maps 0–127 to 0–100 %. Vocoder switch: the chart prints LSB 04(00), 4 is used here.",
